l as e-commerce platforms. Mokingran Jewellery Group Co., Ltd. was founded in 2000 and is based in Tianjin, the People's Republic of China.","description_en":"Mokingran Jewellery Group Co., Ltd., together with its subsidiaries, engages in design, production, wholesale, and retail of jewellery in the People's Republic of China, North America, Europe, the Middle East, Southeast Asia, and internationally. It is also involved in the production and sales of K-gold jewellery, diamond inlaying jewellery, and other products and services; diamond wholesale; and jewellery testing. The company offers its products through an offline network consisting of franchise stores and self-operated stores, as well as e-commerce platforms. Mokingran Jewellery Group Co., Ltd. was founded in 2000 and is based in Tianjin, the People's Republic of China.","description_zh":"Mokingran Jewellery Group Co., Ltd. 及其子公司在中国大陆、北美、欧洲、中东、东南亚及国际市场从事珠宝的设计、生产、批发和零售。公司还从事K金珠宝、钻石镶嵌珠宝及其他产品和服务的生产与销售；钻石批发；以及珠宝检测。公司通过由加盟店和自营店组成的线下网络以及电子商务平台提供其产品。Mokingran Jewellery Group Co., Ltd. 成立于2000年，总部位于中国天津。","address":"No. 15, Ziyuan Road","city":"Tianjin","state":"TJ","zip":null,"country":"CN","phone":null,"full_address":"No. 15, Ziyuan Road, Tianjin, TJ, CN","year_high":42,"year_low":11.34,"range_52w":"11.34-42","all_time_high":null,"all_time_low":null,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[],"stock_splits":[],"news":[],"historical_dcf_series":null,"real_5y_prices":[],"dataAvailability":{"currentPrice":null,"hkdRiskFreeRate":"usdTreasuryProxyNotObservedHkdYield","asReportedLeases":"sourceUnavailable","ownership":"Provider coverage has not been verified for HKEX","historicalDcf":"No point-in-time historical valuations are available"},"ratingSources":{"fScore":{"asOfDate":null,"period":null,"basis":null,"evaluatedTests":0,"passedTests":0,"reason":"missingComparableStatements","evidenceHash":"eb9e7e2a605ac3aab2c392719b1a0d5852301f493289b4e6e9bb7aa59c5688fe","checkedAt":